      "section": "dsh-web-search-tavily",
      "text": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-web-search-tavily\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/npm/v/dsh-web-search-tavily\" alt=\"npm version\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-web-search-tavily\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/npm/dm/dsh-web-search-tavily\" alt=\"npm downloads\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/cnChenKai/dsh-web-search-tavily\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/stars/cnChenKai/dsh-web-search-tavily\" alt=\"GitHub stars\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/cnChenKai/dsh-web-search-tavily/blob/main/LICENSE\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/cnChenKai/dsh-web-search-tavily\" alt=\"License\"></a>\n</p>"
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-web-search-tavily",
      "text": "[English](README.md) | [中文](README.zh.md)\n\nA [Tavily](https://tavily.com)-backed search provider for the [DeepSeek Harness](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness) web capability seam (`ctx.web`): it makes the built-in `web_search` tool run on Tavily's search API instead of the shipped DeepSeek route.\n\n**DSH compatibility:** validated with `0.2.0-rc.2`."
    },
    {
      "section": "Features",
      "text": "- **Keyless mode** - no API key needed at all: the provider sends the official `X-Tavily-Access-Mode: keyless` header when no key is configured. Responses are identical to keyed ones.\n- **Keyed upgrade** - set `TAVILY_API_KEY` in `~/.dsh/.credentials.yaml` or the environment to use the keyed tier (1,000 free credits/month at [app.tavily.com](https://app.tavily.com)). The key is resolved fresh for every search.\n- **Official defaults** - `search_depth: basic` (1 credit), `include_answer: false`, `max_results: 5`, `chunks_per_source: 3`, per [Tavily's agent guidance](https://docs.tavily.com/documentation/agents.md)."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add dsh-web-search-tavily\n```\n\nThen set your API key (optional - keyless mode works without one):\n\n```yaml"
    },
    {
      "section": "~/.dsh/.credentials.yaml",
      "text": "TAVILY_API_KEY: tvly-...\n```\n\nSelect the provider (the bundle patch does this automatically; to switch manually):\n\n```yaml"
    },
    {
      "section": "your profile's cordis.patch.yml",
      "text": "- id: web\n  name: '@deepseek-ai/dsh-web'\n  config:\n    searchProvider: tavily\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "MIT"
    }
  ],
